{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GsSuFUL7aWaG5Cud9UAyZg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 7\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：Pythia-2.8B continuation 链 + Pythia-410M 参考模型 + XGBoost 3-class\\\\n    分类\\\\n  rationale: '选择 continuation（最低语义偏离）作为最可能保留 depth 信号的生成类型；单生成器简化变量；Pythia-410M 作为参考模型避免与生成器的规模/架构循环；XGBoost\\\\n    快速验证无需 GPU 训练。Pass: macro-F1≥0.45 且 gen-0 vs gen-2+ F1≥0.65。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS → 进入研究阶段。首要任务：特征 ablation + depth signal 增量验证\\\\n  rationale: macro-F1=0.84 远超 0.45 阈值，binary F1=0.87 远超 0.65，7/7 特征显著。核心假设成立。但 Reviewer\\\\n    指出 hapax_ratio（表面特征）贡献最大，需 ablation 验证分布指纹的独立价值；gen-1 vs gen-2+ 混淆率高，需量化 depth\\\\n    信号超越 binary 分类的增量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'PASS: macro-F1=0.8408, binary-F1=0.8653'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 2 准备 Plan B framing：若 ablation 显示表面特征足够，叙事从 \\\\\\\"independent signal\\\\\\\"\\\\n    调整为 \\\\\\\"complementary signal\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 Claim 2 是整个叙事的 single point of failure。MVP 中 hapax_ratio\\\\n    importance=0.30，表面特征贡献 47%。Plan B 不 kill 项目，只调 framing 强度——从\\\\\\\"分布指纹独立于表面统计\\\\\\\"降为\\\\\\\"分布指纹提供互补信号\\\\\\\"，核心叙事转为\\\\n    vocabulary impoverishment as primary depth signal。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 2 framing 调整：从 \\\\\\\"Fingerprint Independence\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"Feature Complementarity\\\\n    & Dual Dynamics\\\\\\\"；H1/H2 从二选一转为共存\\\\n  rationale: plan_001 ablation 结果：surface_only (0.76) > reference_only (0.72)，但 full\\\\n    (0.82) 显著优于 surface_only (p=0.0008)。原 Claim 2 \\\\\\\"independent signal\\\\\\\" 被否定，触发 Plan\\\\n    B (D003)。新发现更强：表面特征呈 H2 drift、分布形状特征呈 H1 stationary，dual dynamics 是比原 framing\\\\n    更丰富的科学贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: surface_only 0.76 > reference_only 0.72; full 0.82 显著优于两者; H1/H2 按特征类型共存\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dual dynamics 细化：H1/H2 分界是 level/diversity vs shape，不是 surface vs reference（entropy_mean\\\\n    作为 reference 特征却呈 H2 drift）\\\\n  rationale: plan_001 修正版结果显示 entropy_mean（reference 特征）Spearman ρ=-0.68，呈明显 H2 漂移。原\\\\n    framing 将 dual dynamics 归因于 surface vs reference 的来源差异，实际分界是特征测量什么（central tendency/diversity\\\\n    vs distributional shape）。这是更精确、更有科学价值的发现。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: entropy_mean ρ=-0.68 (H2), entropy_std/max/tail_decay near-stationary\\\\n      (H1)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream D006: framing+plan调整 — 重新定位为实证/概念贡献，补充text length控制、大模型生成器、下游评估多种子'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260514T181213 三档评分 Best=5/Median=5/Worst=4，均未达 best≥6\\\\n    的启动门槛。跨三档一致的结构性问题：(1) 引用严重不足(5篇→需30+)，缺 OOD detection/perplexity-based detection/model\\\\n    collapse/data quality 文献线；(2) 方法论新颖性被过度声称——features 是标准 NLL 统计量+XGBoost，贡献在于问题定义+实证发现+应用，非方法；(3)\\\\n    文本长度混淆未控制(hapax_ratio/TTR 依赖长度)；(4) 生成器规模≤2.8B，缺前沿规模验证；(5) 下游效用单次运行无CI+Pythia-410M循环引用；(6)\\\\n    OOD detection 连接缺失。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    行动：\\\\n\\\\n    - paper_framing.md: 添加 RC8-RC11, Contribution Positioning 节，重新定位为实证/概念贡献\\\\n\\\\n    - experiment_plan.yaml: 新增 plan_013 (text_length_control, P0), plan_014 (large_scale_generator,\\\\n    P1)；修改 plan_004 (OLMo-1B替代Pythia-410M, 多种子+CI, 样本量匹配)\\\\n\\\\n    - 全局要求：所有实验报告 bootstrap CI\\\\n\\\\n    - 需 re-dream 验证改动后评分是否达标，达标后才批准后续 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n    - plan-002 数据生成继续（数据不受 framing 影响）'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: data generation in progress\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: text length control added\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: large scale generator added\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_004\\\\n    role: modified\\\\n    result: OLMo-1B + multi-seed + CI\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3727, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKa8TbxxLe3KPHD7hXgQEV","session_id":"f3f9a5e8-566d-4365-91f3-180932bffac4","uuid":"fb955068-7469-46c1-968f-24a26b0e4acf","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:59:48.192Z"}
